<title>USA: Peru buys 5,000 Tonnes U.S. brown rice - trade.</title>
<headline>Peru buys 5,000 Tonnes U.S. brown rice - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A private buyer in Peru bought over the weekend a total of 5,000 tonnes U.S. long grain Grade 2 brown rice slated for April 10-May 5 delivery, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>No other details were given.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
